{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 86,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        231.10589599609375,
        21.884788513183594,
        277.722412109375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.722412109375,
        21.884788513183594,
        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.1881103515625,
        513.4375,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "follow-up of asymptomatic children (every 2-3 months for the first 6 months, then",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        99.18463134765625,
        513.3800659179688,
        112.5361328125
      ],
      "text": "6-monthly for at least 2 years) is recommended. If TB disease develops, treatment with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.18115234375,
        513.3684692382812,
        128.53265380859375
      ],
      "text": "an appropriate DR-TB regimen based on the DST pattern of the presumed source case",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.17767333984375,
        182.17987060546875,
        144.5291748046875
      ],
      "text": "should be initiated.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        155.68414306640625,
        513.3568725585938,
        169.03564453125
      ],
      "text": "Care providers should note that younger children are more at risk of progressing to TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        171.6806640625,
        123.38040161132812,
        185.03216552734375
      ],
      "text": "disease.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        207.0551300048828,
        128.81739807128906,
        223.9111328125
      ],
      "text": "7.5\t T",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        129.0334014892578,
        211.0619354248047,
        184.2661895751953,
        222.8611297607422
      ],
      "text": "reatment",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        231.60394287109375,
        513.4260864257812,
        244.9554443359375
      ],
      "text": "The treatment of MDR-TB and XDR-TB in children is guided by the same principles and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        247.6004638671875,
        513.4606323242188,
        260.95196533203125
      ],
      "text": "uses the same second-line drugs as the treatment in adults, although optimal durations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        263.59698486328125,
        513.3684692382812,
        276.948486328125
      ],
      "text": "of regimens are not known. MDR-TB is associated with poorer treatment outcomes and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        279.5245056152344,
        360.87835693359375,
        292.94500732421875
      ],
      "text": "(8, 9) higher mortality than drug-sensitive TB in children  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        305.7684326171875,
        262.8433837890625,
        322.4964294433594
      ],
      "text": "Treatment of monoresistant TB",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        326.3424987792969,
        513.391357421875,
        339.6940002441406
      ],
      "text": "Where monoresistance to isoniazid is known or suspected when treatment is initiated,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        342.3389892578125,
        513.427978515625,
        355.6940002441406
      ],
      "text": "or when there is high background prevalence of isoniazid resistance,  the addition  1",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0413818359375,
        358.3389892578125,
        513.4625244140625,
        371.69049072265625
      ],
      "text": "of ethambutol to isoniazid, rifampicin and pyrazinamide in the intensive phase is",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0413818359375,
        374.3354797363281,
        513.4280395507812,
        387.6869812011719
      ],
      "text": "recommended (see Chapter 4). For patients with more extensive disease, consideration",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0413818359375,
        390.33197021484375,
        513.4396362304688,
        403.6834716796875
      ],
      "text": "should be given to the addition of a fluoroquinolone and to prolonging treatment to a",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0413818359375,
        406.3284606933594,
        513.4740600585938,
        419.6799621582031
      ],
      "text": "minimum of 9 months. Monoresistance to rifampicin should be treated with isoniazid,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0413818359375,
        422.324951171875,
        513.4625244140625,
        435.67645263671875
      ],
      "text": "ethambutol and a fluoroquinolone for at least 12–18 months, with the addition of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0413818359375,
        438.25244140625,
        322.1024169921875,
        451.6729431152344
      ],
      "text": "(10) pyrazinamide for at least the first 2 months  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        464.50689697265625,
        254.85137939453125,
        481.2348937988281
      ],
      "text": "Treatment of polyresistant TB",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        485.08111572265625,
        513.4949340820312,
        498.4326171875
      ],
      "text": "Polyresistance refers to resistance to two or more first-line drugs but not to both isoniazid",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        501.00860595703125,
        401.33538818359375,
        514.4290771484375
      ],
      "text": "(10) and rifampicin. Suggested treatment regimens are available  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        527.2455444335938,
        292.8433837890625,
        543.9735717773438
      ],
      "text": "Treatment of multidrug-resistant TB",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        547.750732421875,
        513.3685302734375,
        561.1712036132812
      ],
      "text": "(2). Children with MDR-TB are treated in a similar way to adults with MDR-TB   One",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        563.8162231445312,
        513.380126953125,
        577.167724609375
      ],
      "text": "practical difference is that confirmation and DST may not possible, so that empirical",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        579.8126831054688,
        513.4606323242188,
        593.1641845703125
      ],
      "text": "treatment is often required for children with suspected MDR-TB. Although outcome",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        595.8092041015625,
        513.4834594726562,
        609.1607055664062
      ],
      "text": "data in children are limited, the available evidence suggests that outcomes at least as",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        611.7367553710938,
        370.515380859375,
        625.1572265625
      ],
      "text": "(10, 11) good as those reported in adults can be achieved  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        636.3121948242188,
        357.7044677734375,
        649.6636962890625
      ],
      "text": "Management should adhere to the following principles:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        660.8275146484375,
        513.4176635742188,
        674.1790161132812
      ],
      "text": "Never add a single drug to a failing regimen; this may lead to amplification of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        664.4993896484375,
        91.36740112304688,
        672.4993896484375
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        676.8240356445312,
        155.7790069580078,
        690.175537109375
      ],
      "text": "resistance.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        698.8275146484375,
        422.68255615234375,
        712.1790161132812
      ],
      "text": "All treatment should be given daily and under direct observation.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        702.4993896484375,
        91.36740112304688,
        710.4993896484375
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        720.8275146484375,
        513.3945922851562,
        734.1790161132812
      ],
      "text": "Treat the child according to the DST results from the likely source case, unless M.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        724.4993896484375,
        91.36740112304688,
        732.4993896484375
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        736.7550659179688,
        417.1280517578125,
        750.175537109375
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis  culture and DST results are available from the child.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        792.6054077148438,
        241.26454162597656,
        804.6054077148438
      ],
      "text": "See “Definitions and distinctions” section. 1",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "67",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}